// Dialog :
"P2152474861" "Hero 1's letter was stolen by the Rikti? How? I don't understand what would they want with his letter.<br><br>Please explain this to me."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3933621115" "Wait, you saw <color deepskyblue>Hero 1</color> at the memorial? That can't be... oh, it was a magical ward he placed down before he left. This city never ceases to amaze me.<br><br>Well, the memorial needs your help and from the sounds of it the fate of the Rikti war could hang in the balance.<br><br>I know it sounds like just another day in Paragon City, but imagine what could happen if the Rikti manage to succeed at their goal, whatever it be. Good luck."
// AcceptString :
"P3094440442" "Retrieve Hero 1's letter"
// SendOffString :
"P674256244" "You've got to find Hero 1's letter. We owe it to him. I can't imagine what the Rikti would want with it, but it can't be good."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1356467711" "Defeat the Rikti Thieves"

