// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3065434317" "You have the letter? Excellent. I'll make sure it's returned to the Memorial.<br><br>I'm very proud to bestow upon you the right to wear a cape. I know Hero 1 himself would be glad to see you wearing it. You represent everything he died fighting for. Maybe we don't say it enough, {HeroName}, but this city is lucky to have you."
// RandomFameString :
"P2946619448" "Did you see {HeroName}'s new cape? Stylish!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnFailure 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2325953670" "I'll dispatch a team of heroes to see if they can recover any fragment of Hero 1's letter. Don't feel bad, {HeroName}. The Lost ambushed you. I can't give you a cape this time, but if you want to try again, I'll be here."

